3. PUBLIC RECORDS — public/assets/documents/
-------------------------------------
The documents include public records obtained from Arkansas state agencies
through Freedom of Information Act requests, historical public excerpts, and
reviewed publication derivatives. Exact source locators and publication
treatments identify crops, omissions and existing campaign annotations.
The campaign claims no copyright in the underlying agency records. Verify
source context and applicable rights when reusing records or excerpts.

Some items in these productions are privately authored works that were present
in the agencies' files — for example the Arkansas Democrat-Gazette news article
(walther-10m-purchase-news-coverage-2023.pdf) and other third-party
correspondence. Those remain the copyright of their respective authors or
publishers; they are reproduced here as evidence, are NOT placed in the public
domain by the campaign, and any reuse is governed by their own rights holders
and applicable law (such as fair use).


